rk creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Dark powers to defeat Light creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each attack you make transforms the tiles on the battlefield into the form of the attack when you defeat an enemy. But beware, the balance is fragile, and it is entirely up to you to protect it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007420/extras/0f50e41a715a157efc6edc0fd77cac24.poster.avif?t=1763969574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007420/extras/0f50e41a715a157efc6edc0fd77cac24.webm?t=1763969574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007420/extras/0f50e41a715a157efc6edc0fd77cac24.mp4?t=1763969574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Light vs. Dark combat: defeat enemies with the opposite form of their own! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite progression: unlock permanent skill upgrades and experience different challenges in each region battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving battlefield: the terrain changes form based on your attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging enemies, elites, and boss: face unique threats that evolve over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all collectible pieces dropped by final bosses, seal all regions under attack, and preserve the balance!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability: each playthrough offers new choices, upgrades, and challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Acthera Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}